# Vantix Site Lock (approved baseline)

This project is locked at tag **`site-lock-v1`** on `main`.

## Do not change without explicit user approval

- **AliveGrid** (`components/system/AliveGrid.tsx`, grid CSS in `app/globals.css`)
- **Hero layout + orb** (`components/hero/Hero.tsx`, `components/ui/HeroOrb.tsx`)
- **Global motion stack** (`components/system/*`, `lib/motion.ts`, `lib/gsap.ts`, `lib/cursorStore.ts`)
- **Section motion/reveal patterns** across `components/sections/*`
- **Overall visual character**: dark monochrome, subtle liveness, no redesigns

## Allowed without asking

- Bug fixes that restore intended behavior
- Copy/content updates the user requests
- Booking form wiring, API, or contrast fixes if broken

## Restore this version

```bash
git checkout site-lock-v1
```
